\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Burgers wave propagation, Carleman--QSVT: classical (dashed) vs.\ dense QSVT (solid) vs.\ Pauli-LCU QSVT (dotted). At this viscosity ($\nu =0.1$) diffusion dominates advection, so the profile decays and mildly skews rather than steepening into a shock; the three curves coincide to numerical precision because both block encodings are here shown to implement the same Carleman-lifted operator $A$ correctly, not merely a plausible one.}}{6}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
